# Phase 3 reproduction package: track the code and reports, not the frozen
# training checkpoints (297MB). Teammates receive those through the private
# artifact channel described in final_submission/README.md.
final_submission/code/reproduction_inputs/
final_submission/code/lineage_inputs/
final_submission/code/data/*
!final_submission/code/data/README.md
# Frozen lookup the reproduction package needs; the repository copy under
# src/team_assets/ is pinned by the same hash in scripts/audit_repository.py.

# Internal audit evidence bundle: kept locally, not in history.
research/reports/internal_audit_20260906/*.zip
# Public repository: never track DACON-derived data.
#
# The competition forbids redistributing the provided data, and these files
# carry it in derived form - OOF arrays hold the train target and player ids,
# the submission archives embed per-player count/success priors, and the
# linkage tables reconstruct the pitcher and game id mapping. They stay local
# and reach official teammates through the private channel in
# docs/ARTIFACT_HANDOFF.md.
artifacts/oof_champion_*/
artifacts/standalone_champion_*/
submissions/releases/
**/fallback_lookups.joblib
final_submission/code/fallback_xgb/pitcher_map.csv
final_submission/code/h1/pitcher_id_map.csv
research/reports/top1100/player_mapping_by_origin.csv
research/reports/top1100/alignment_game_candidates.csv
research/reports/trackman_linkage.csv
research/reports/trackman_domain_linkage.csv
research/reports/trackman_command_proxy_census_*/origin_physical_profiles.csv
